# The Flutter web gallery the Mobile component pages embed is BUILT, not
# committed: the repo needs the Flutter toolchain anyway (the mobile gates), so
# carrying ~17 MB of build output in git — re-added on every gallery change and
# kept forever — buys nothing. `apps/website`'s build runs
# scripts/ensure-mobile-gallery.mjs, which rebuilds only when its inputs change.
apps/website/public/mobile-preview/
